OL,3,GNEWSA'My army dream was ended by
OL,4,Achildhood eye surgery'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLewis Jackson cannot remember a time
OL,7,Fwhen he did not want to join the army
OL,8,Fand continue a family tradition of
OL,9,Fmilitary service going back to World
OL,10,FWar One. That dream was shattered,
OL,11,Fthough, when his application was
OL,12,Frejected on medical grounds.
OL,14,F"Serving my country has always been a
OL,15,Fdream of mine and I never considered
OL,16,Fthat I'd do anything else," said the
OL,17,F21-year-old.
OL,19,FJackson, from Cirencester, was turned
OL,20,Fdown by the Army because he had
OL,21,Fcataract surgery at the age of three.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
