OL,3,GNEWSA'My army dream was ended by
OL,4,Achildhood eye surgery'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ministry of Defence (MoD)
OL,7,Fspokesperson said: "Service in the
OL,8,FArmed Forces is physically demanding,
OL,9,Fso it's right that we have sensible
OL,10,Fhealth and recruitment policies which
OL,11,Fmaintain operational effectiveness but
OL,12,Fdon't unnecessarily exclude people."
